00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.311
Week 10: Likes, Preferences, and Leisure. express likes and dislikes invite and suggest compare activities

2
00:00:07.311 --> 00:00:29.223
Read for the situation. A Camila le encanta el cine, pero a Diego le interesan más los deportes. Buscan una actividad que puedan disfrutar juntos y eligen un festival al aire libre. Camila loves movies, but Diego is more interested in sports. They look for an activity they can enjoy together and choose an outdoor festival.

